0..48 Comment "//! This fixture defines a constant type family."
49..52 Comment "//!"
53..98 Comment "//! The family ignores each natural argument."
99..102 Comment "//!"
103..179 Comment "//! A family applied at its binder is a dependent codomain until the checker"
180..257 Comment "//! reads the family. A family that reads to one type at every argument makes"
258..336 Comment "//! the function type over it the arrow to that type. The checker converts the"
337..371 Comment "//! two arrows in both directions."
372..375 Comment "//!"
376..432 Comment "//! - cites: [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]"
433..436 Comment "//!"
437..609 Comment "//! [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]: https://archive-pml.github.io/martin-lof/pdfs/Bibliopolis-Book-retypeset-1984.pdf \"Martin-Löf, Intuitionistic Type Theory\""
